<tr><td>privilege</td><td>advantages some people have because of wealth or status</td><td>Privileg</td></tr>
<tr><td>inheritance</td><td>money or property passed on after death</td><td>Erbe</td></tr>
<tr><td>trauma</td><td>deep emotional shock</td><td>Trauma</td></tr>
<tr><td>symbol</td><td>an object that stands for an idea</td><td>Symbol</td></tr>
<tr><td>irony</td><td>result opposite to what was intended</td><td>Ironie</td></tr>
<tr><td>deception</td><td>making someone believe something false</td><td>Täuschung</td></tr></table></div>
<ul><li><strong>Argument:</strong> "Lockhart suggests that…", "This shows that…"</li>
<li><strong>Evidence:</strong> "This is illustrated when…", "For example, Granddad…"</li>
<li><strong>Analysis:</strong> "This reveals…", "The effect is to…"</li>
<li><strong>Conclusion:</strong> "Overall, the novel shows…", "Ultimately…"</li></ul>
<p>Use PEEL: <strong>P</strong>oint, <strong>E</strong>vidence, <strong>E</strong>xplanation, <strong>L</strong>ink back to the question.</p></section>

